# Grace startup smoke: the xmgrace main window must come up against the
# libx11-compat + Motif + libXt stack with a fixture loaded, render the plot
# canvas (axes plus a curve, not a blank drawing area), and stay alive. The
# shared common-visible assertion (non-empty plus not-all-black) catches a
# "window mapped but blank canvas" regression without a calibrated baseline.
delay 1500
wait-window "Grace" 15000
# Grace's plot canvas repaints continuously under a live X display (Xvfb), so it
# never quiets for wait-converge the way a static toolbox does; a fixed settle
# delay is used instead, matching the xfig startup replay. common-visible is
# tolerant of a mid-repaint frame (non-empty, not all black).
delay 3000
screenshot initial
assert-image initial common-visible.json
assert-exit running
